POST {{host}}/your-custom-login-path
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf_token}}

{
  "username": "test",
  "password": "test"
}

### 5. test 用户访问 /test 专属接口 (权限允许)
GET {{host}}/test
Accept: text/plain

### 6. test 用户访问 /admin 专属接口 (权限不足，触发 403 页面/拒绝)
GET {{host}}/admin
Accept: text/plain
